abstract: >
  PMAT (Pragmatic Multi-language Agent Toolkit) provides zero-configuration
  AI context generation for any codebase. It includes technical debt grading,
  mutation testing, repository scoring, semantic search, and MCP integration
  for AI assistants like Claude Code and Cline.
